# Unreferenced source artwork. These are multi-megabyte originals that nothing
# in the app imports — manifest.json uses only /icons/logo.png and layout.tsx
# only /icons/icon-512.png. Uploading them stalled `vercel deploy` on a slow
# uplink (10.9MB payload, aborted mid-transfer). They stay in git; they just
# don't ship.
public/icons/icon-192.png
public/icons/favicon.png
public/icons/LoDi-*.png
public/icons/ChatGPT Image*.png

# Local-only. Leading slash anchors to the repo root — an unanchored
# `supabase/` also matches src/lib/supabase/ and breaks the build.
/supabase/
/*.md
